{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "c846ab8911f3451b9487717d15234ebf", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "生成2026-09-18 08:00经营简报", "id": "77c3d60c1b2d478ca6b0bedc6da80bc4", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:20.425717", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "da7df5012d06494a9eb8d82d9ff76092", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:20.425771", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "金汉隆AI数据中枢智能体", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The user wants a daily business brief for 2026-09-18 08:00. Let me first check the datahub skill.\n\nLet me load the skill instructions.", "id": "bad99336d8bf468c8ee67785ad3fab68", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:21.751823", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_6b5df883198f42ac86c6f7f9", "name": "Skill", "input": "{\"skill\": \"datahub\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:22.213225", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_6b5df883198f42ac86c6f7f9", "name": "Skill", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "# 金汉隆 AI 数据中枢技能\n\n本技能目录 `scripts/` 下四件工具（以本 SKILL.md 所在目录为根；若当前目录不是技能目录，先 find/glob 定位 `datahub/scripts/query.py`）：\n\n| 脚本 | 用途 | 示例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `scripts/query.py` | 对计算副本 `datahub/agent_data.sqlite` 执行只读 SQL（mode=ro，仅 SELECT/PRAGMA） | `python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders\"` |\n| `scripts/kb_search.py` | 检索《金汉隆-数据中枢》知识库（含30张表全量数据与口径文档） | `python3 datahub/scripts/kb_search.py \"订单完成的口径是什么\"` |\n| `scripts/calc.py` | 均值 / 最小二乘斜率 / 变化率（支持 7 点均值、14 点回归场景） | `python3 datahub/scripts/calc.py 0.47,0.45,0.42` |\n| `scripts/collect.py` | 多源采集演练：raw -> 标准化/去重/坏样本隔离 -> datahub/output/ | `python3 datahub/scripts/collect.py` |\n\n工作区数据目录 `datahub/`：`agent_data.sqlite`（计算副本）、`docs/`（schema/字段字典/口径/示例SQL）、`raw/`（采集源样本）、`output/`（输出目录，可写）。\n\n## 使用规则\n\n1. **数字必须来自 query.py / calc.py 的真实计算**，不得凭知识库片段心算全量汇总；知识库用于口径、字段说明与证据。\n2. 固定快照时间从 `configuration.snapshot_at` 读取（= 2026-09-18 08:00 北京时间），不得用机器当前日期。\n3. 只读纪律：query.py 以 mode=ro 打开数据库，不得写库、不得回写企业系统。\n4. 发送动作只允许 Mock 推送：`POST http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push`，`recipient_group=MOCK_MANAGEMENT`，带 `idempotency_key`（重复请求会被幂等忽略）。\n5. 输出附：订单号/工单号、时间窗口、单位、原始证据（SQL 或文档出处）；概率类输出标注\"演示评分，未校准\"。\n\n## 不适用场景\n\n- 与企业数据无关的通用闲聊/写作（直接回答即可）。", "id": "79eb64dd53044972852e2e1b1a4b1aaa", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:22.282412", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:22.284152", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me look at the workspace structure and docs first.", "id": "31293a9446784c3eaf5a6369934443d4", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:23.715487", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_11e9011a95334e808d45ba9a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"ls -la && echo \\\"--- datahub ---\\\" && ls -la datahub && echo \\\"--- docs ---\\\" && ls -la datahub/docs\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:23.948766", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_67b7b1a7b9a04968a0ccdea7", "name": "memory_search", "input": "{\"query\": \"经营简报 每日08点 简报 格式 口径\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:24.625158", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_67b7b1a7b9a04968a0ccdea7", "name": "memory_search", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "(no memory results)", "id": "9cd739a053a54b4f8d2c11f9017e22c5", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:24.915217", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:24.916814", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_11e9011a95334e808d45ba9a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "total 5396\ndrwxr-xr-x 17 root root    4096 Sep 17 23:43 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  9 root root    4096 Sep 17 22:14 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root       0 Sep 17 19:58 .bootstrap_completed\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root       0 Sep 17 19:52 .skill.json.lock\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root    2281 Sep 17 21:31 AGENTS.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root    1354 Sep 17 16:21 BOOTSTRAP.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root     614 Sep 17 16:21 CONTACTS.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root     242 Sep 17 16:21 HEARTBEAT.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root    7193 Sep 17 16:21 MAIL_TRIAGE.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root    3661 Sep 17 23:38 MEMORY.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root     645 Sep 17 16:21 PROFILE.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root    1598 Sep 17 16:21 SOUL.md\n-rw-------  1 root root   26941 Sep 17 21:31 agent.json\n-rw-------  1 root root   11761 Sep 17 23:43 chats.json\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root    4096 Sep 17 21:59 checkpoints\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 root root    4096 Sep 17 21:31 datahub\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 21:31 digest\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root    4096 Sep 17 19:52 drivers\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root 5083136 Sep 17 23:43 history.db\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root   32768 Sep 17 23:43 history.db-shm\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root  247232 Sep 17 23:43 history.db-wal\n-rw-------  1 root root    2150 Sep 17 22:19 jobs.json\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 22:22 jobs_history\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 21:31 media\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 19:52 mem_agent\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 root root    4096 Sep 17 19:52 mem_metadata\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 19:52 mem_session\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 19:52 memory\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 19:52 resource\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root    4096 Sep 17 22:46 sessions\n-rw-------  1 root root    3473 Sep 17 21:59 skill.json\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 root root    4096 Sep 17 21:31 skills\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 23:43 state\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root    4096 Sep 17 21:31 tmp\n--- datahub ---\ntotal 10964\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 17 root root     4096 Sep 17 23:43 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root 11202560 Sep 17 21:09 agent_data.sqlite\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:31 docs\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root     4096 Sep 17 23:38 output\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:09 raw\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root     4096 Sep 17 22:18 scripts\n--- docs ---\ntotal 108\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root  4096 Sep 17 21:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root  4096 Sep 17 21:31 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 37870 Sep 17 21:09 schema.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  6514 Sep 17 21:09 业务口径要点.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 48930 Sep 17 21:09 字段字典.csv\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   860 Sep 17 21:09 查询入门.sql", "id": "eedcdfa966c54147be07f2c8ba24bf5f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:24.923478", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:24.924528", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me read the business caliber doc and check MEMORY.md for prior brief format decisions.", "id": "07aeae4eb88e42fb8ecf6e1ab10f5b44", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:26.407397", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_877ffd6feae14f6c87dbc4e8", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/docs/业务口径要点.md\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:26.846053", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_66d8d67aac0842e382371e36", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"MEMORY.md\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:27.082123", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_877ffd6feae14f6c87dbc4e8", "name": "read_file", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "# 金汉隆 AI智能数据中枢 · 业务口径要点（供智能体检索）\n\n> 本文档为数据中枢智能体的口径与纪律说明，配套直读库 agent_data.sqlite 使用。\n\n## 固定模拟时间（重要）\n\n- **模拟时点：2026-09-18 08:00:00（Asia/Shanghai）**，必须从 `configuration.snapshot_at` 读取，不能用运行机器的当前时间。\n- 原始下单日期覆盖 2025-12 至 2026-09；每日经营序列覆盖 2025-12-01 至 2026-09-17（291 个完整自然日）。\n- 800 笔源订单中，**769 笔已生效；31 笔为未来样本**（未来样本不产生工单、生产、库存或物流流水）。只分析已生效订单。\n- 计划交期、供应商预计到货和预测交付可以晚于快照；实际开始、完工、出入库、签收等观测不能晚于快照。实际时间为空表示未发生（NULL 表示未发生或不适用，不是 0）。\n\n## 核心关联键与纪律\n\n- `orders.sales_order_id` 是订单主键；`work_orders.work_order_id` 是工单主键；生产、质检、仓储、物流、报工和异常记录同时保留订单号或工单号。\n- **禁止仅按合同编号跨表关联**：原表合同编号存在重号（如 \"20251217\" 对应两笔不同订单）。\n- 原表旧看板的 221 单口径不再采用；当前以源明细 800 单为准。\n- \"包装产品\"（packaged_goods）是客户要包装的食品、药品等，**不能当作本企业设备产量**；本企业设备/配件 SKU 以 products 为准。\n\n## 订单完成与进度口径\n\n- **订单完成 = 全量签收**（不是发货，不是质检通过）。分批发货按运单数量累计，只有最后一批全部签收才计完成。\n- 成品入库、发货、签收分别有独立数量和时间；部分发货的剩余数量 = 订单数量 - 已发数量。\n- 进度看板需区分：计划/加工或采购/装配/质检/发货状态；节点超时；未开始与进行中分开。\n\n## 跨部门融合口径（需求4）\n\n- **人效 = 标准工时产出 / 实际投入人时**；出勤人数按员工去重；**工时利用率 = 投入人时 / 出勤人时**；设备运行分钟不是人时。\n- **作业折算产值 = 标准工时产出 × 标准工时产值率**：是管理估值，**不是财务收入**；完工对应合同价值另列，两者不能混加。\n- 先按日期/工作中心等目标粒度**预聚合再联接**；禁止多事实表直接 JOIN 后 SUM（会造成金额翻倍）。\n\n## 库存与损耗口径\n\n- 原材料批次期初为 0，入库为正、出库为负（wms_transactions 的符号已标准化）。\n- 损耗出库和生产领料分开；**损耗率按成本计算，不跨物料单位相加**。\n- 订单成本 = 已发生的材料耗用 + 损耗 + 分摊人工 + 机台运行 + 物流（各分项四舍五入到分后汇总）；不含未发生采购、税费和全部销售行政费用。\n\n## 异常与报销口径（需求5）\n\n- 三个指标严格区分：**异常事件条数 / 新增异常工单数 / 日末未关闭异常工单数**。\n- 报销提交量按**报销单号去重**；不能把 OA 审批节点数当报销笔数。\n\n## 趋势分析口径（需求6）\n\n- 工作中心趋势按**\"最近有作业日\"**计算；企业实物完工趋势按**自然日**计算（停工日产量为 0）。\n- 默认下降规则：近 7 个点均值相对前 7 个点**下降超过 10%**，且近 14 个点**线性回归斜率为负**。\n- 物理产量按**台/套/件分别统计**，不能相加；跨产品比较可使用明确标注的标准工时产出。\n- 不要仅从下降曲线断言原因，应结合设备报警、停机与报工记录核查；缺失采集不应被误记为停工零产出。\n\n## 风险预警口径（需求2）\n\n- 红色阈值 ≥0.65；黄色 ≥0.30 且 <0.65；其余绿色。\n- **已超过承诺日期且未全量签收的订单：延期已经发生**，单独标为\"已发生的延期事实\"，不能包装成高准确率预测。\n- 概率为**演示评分/经验概率**，未经真实数据校准，不得宣称生产环境准确率；条件尾部样本不足的外推必须披露。\n- 输出需含：概率或评分、红黄绿、P50/P90 预计交付、依据、样本量与不足说明。\n\n## 采集口径（需求3）\n\n- WMS 方向决定正负号；MES 时间戳是毫秒、时长是秒；Excel 工时台账用**分钟**；需做单位与时间标准化。\n- 去重：事件按 `event_id` 识别重复；库存流水按 `transaction_id` 避免重复记账。\n- 同一工序的\"开始\"和\"完成\"事件不能仅因业务键相同就全部忽略，需结合 `event_at/sequence` 判断先后。\n- 重复接收同一事件时库存不得重复增减；脏数据隔离到独立区并出采集日志，干净数据不得引入孤儿订单、错单位、未来实际事件。\n- 遇到数量冲突、模糊交期、无效关联键时进入**人工复核**，不静默覆盖。\n\n## 六项需求对应的数据映射\n\n| 需求 | 输入事实表 | 应输出 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 订单进度看板 | orders、work_orders、stage_nodes、quality_inspections、wms_transactions、shipments | 计划/加工或采购/装配/质检/发货状态；节点超时；分批发货与全量签收；未开始与进行中分开 |\n| 2 交付风险预警 | 历史节点周期、历史签收时效、当前未完工节点、procurement_lines、logistics_events、exceptions | 延期概率/评分、红黄绿、P50/P90 预计交付、依据、样本量 |\n| 3 多源自动采集 | ERP JSON、WMS JSONL、MES 日志、Excel 台账、OA JSON、微信订单图 | 字段映射、单位与时间标准化、去重、隔离异常、结构化入库及采集日志 |\n| 4 跨部门融合 | orders、labor_logs、attendance、employees、mes_events、wms_transactions | 订单量、出勤人数、人时、人效、作业折算产值、损耗成本、工时利用率 |\n| 5 每日8点简报 | shipments、exceptions、expenses、订单关联信息 | 前一自然日交付订单量、新增/未关闭异常工单、报销笔数与金额，一页简报及推送 |\n| 6 趋势分析 | labor_logs、attendance、mes_events、标准工时产出、成品入库（按台/套/件） | 7 点移动平均、14 点线性回归、下降提示与可追溯辅助证据 |\n\n## 禁止动作\n\n- 任何发送动作只能使用**包内 Mock 推送接口**（recipient_group=MOCK_MANAGEMENT），**禁止真实发信、真实微信推送或写回企业系统**。\n- 没有证据不要编造原因；概率无法校准时说明是演示评分/经验概率。\n", "id": "db27ef2c4fbc4b7391e32297b2f5b88d", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:27.223651", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:27.225802", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_66d8d67aac0842e382371e36", "name": "read_file", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "---\nsummary: \"数据中枢智能体长期记忆\"\n---\n\n# MEMORY\n\n## 固定事实\n\n- 快照时间：2026-09-18 08:00 +08:00（从 configuration.snapshot_at 读取）。\n- 计算副本：`datahub/agent_data.sqlite`（只读）。知识库：《金汉隆-数据中枢》id=4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382。\n- Mock 推送：http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push（MOCK_MANAGEMENT，幂等）。\n\n## 工具设置\n\n- query.py：只读 SQL；calc.py：均值/斜率/变化率；kb_search.py：知识库问数；collect.py：采集演练。\n- 所有输出文件写入 `datahub/output/`。\n\n## 经验\n\n- **WMS 去重不能只信 flow_id**：坏样本 BAD-WMS-NEG / BAD-WMS-UNIT 把 flow_id 改写成 BAD-*，但 `payload.source_record_id` 仍是已入库的 WMS0000002 / WMS0000001 → 属\"冲突重发\"。去重须同时校验 payload.source_record_id + 业务指纹 (so_no,mo_no,item,lot,event_time,qty,uom)，命中即隔离，永不覆盖已入库值。\n- **WMS 符号契约**：原始流 qty 恒为非负（5418 条实测 0 负值），正负号由 direction 决定；库内 signed_quantity 才带符号（采购入库/成品入库为正，领料/损耗/销售出库/外购转成品为负）。\n- **单位域只有 台/套/件/批**（wms_transactions 5418 条）；\"公斤\"等质量单位无换算系数，禁止折算入库，跨产品折算只用\"标准工时产出\"。\n- **MES 三字段自洽**：clean 源 9127 条中 start>end=0、end-start≠duration_sec*1000 为 0、快照后事件=0 → duration_sec 可信，可用 `end = start + duration_sec*1000` 确定性修复倒置件；修复后仍要按 mes_event_id 比对既有事件，命中即幂等忽略。\n- **ERP 源字段语义**：`raw/erp/work_orders.json` 的 `billNo` 就是工单号（MO…，769 条无重复、saleNo 无空），不是销售订单号；saleNo/sku 分别须命中 orders(800)/products(16)。\n- **OA 契约**：form_id 形如 `OA-REIMxxxxx`，submitted_at 必为带时区 ISO8601（840 条无 date-only），必填 form_type/applicant_employee_id/status/form_payload；金额在 form_payload.金额。\n- 2026-09-18 处置 9 条坏样本：1 维持幂等忽略、2 驳回（BAD-MES-TIME 与 MES000001 同源损坏重发；BAD-MES-FUTURE 所属工单 2026-01-06 已全量签收）、6 进人工复核清单；对干净表影响 0（8 张表 BAD-* 扫描 0 命中）。产物：`datahub/output/bad_cases_review_20260918.md` / `.csv`。\n- **微信截图核对走视觉直读，不必装 OCR**：环境无 tesseract/pytesseract/easyocr，但模型多模态可用，`view_image` 直接读 `datahub/raw/wechat/CHAT_*.png` 即可；数量等关键字段有疑义时用 PIL `crop+resize` 放大再读一遍（本次靠这步确认 009/010 的\"3\"非误读）。\n- **`source_documents` 是图片↔订单号的权威台账**：DOC001-012 已预绑定 sales_order_id 且 `ingestion_status='待识别'`，所以\"截图找不到订单\"这类风险可先排除；核对时以它为准做 1:1 映射，不要靠订单号字符串自己猜（注意 SO…-0210 是 4 位、SO…-00671 是 5 位，两种位数并存）。\n- **截图 vs ERP 核对要分三层**：①截图与 ERP 差异（数量/交期）→ 人工复核；②ERP 自身风险标记 `source_risk_flag/reason` → 与①独立列，别混为一谈；③ERP 内部自洽性（`work_orders.planned_finish_at` > `orders.promised_delivery_at`）→ 截图完全一致的单也可能有，必须单独查。\n- **判断\"是否重复新建\"看 orders 唯一性 + 同客户同产品多单**：800 行 DISTINCT=800 即无重复；同 (customer_id,product_id) 的其他在效单是独立订单不是重复单，只作并单建议。\n", "id": "3c6f669439cf4018ab1aadcb6ea6f649", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:27.224319", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:27.230826", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me check the configuration.snapshot_at and the schema for relevant tables (shipments, exceptions, expenses, orders). Also check output dir for previous briefs.\n\n需求5: 每日8点简报 — 前一自然日交付订单量、新增/未关闭异常工单、报销笔数与金额，一页简报及推送。\n\nNote: snapshot is 2026-09-18 08:00, so \"前一自然日\" = 2026-09-17.\n\nLet me check the DB schema.", "id": "09a900edd9ac4973bd5e72fa17e38c60", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:29.022258", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_2bc6f21187c74a2d9e376f2b", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"ls -la datahub/output datahub/scripts && echo \\\"--- snapshot ---\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT * FROM configuration\\\" 2>&1 | head -40\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:30.369182", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_dd927625cb6c474f993331d7", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table' ORDER BY name\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:30.897717", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_dd927625cb6c474f993331d7", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "name\n----------------------------------------\nattendance\nconfiguration\ncustomers\ndepartments\nemployees\nequipment\nexceptions\nexpenses\ningestion_runs\nlabor_logs\nlogistics_events\nmaterials\nmes_events\noa_forms\norders\nprocurement_lines\nproducts\nquality_inspections\nquality_issues\nroutes\nshipments\nsource_audit\nsource_documents\nsource_mappings\nstage_nodes\nsuppliers\nwarehouses\nwms_transactions\nwork_orders\nworkcenters\n(30 rows)", "id": "0991366aa9744ecdb2fbb2a9b99d85ca", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:31.213612", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:31.214778", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_2bc6f21187c74a2d9e376f2b", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "datahub/output:\ntotal 472\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root   4096 Sep 17 23:38 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root   4096 Sep 17 21:31 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  95795 Sep 17 23:23 _risk_raw.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   3517 Sep 17 23:18 _tmp_calib.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   2780 Sep 17 23:19 _tmp_calib1.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   1971 Sep 17 23:19 _tmp_calib2.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   1316 Sep 17 23:20 _tmp_calib2b.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  11904 Sep 17 23:23 _tmp_final.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   2576 Sep 17 23:17 _tmp_intransit.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   1810 Sep 17 23:18 _tmp_residual.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   1672 Sep 17 23:18 _tmp_residual2.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   4815 Sep 17 23:18 _tmp_unshipped.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   1313 Sep 17 23:19 _tmp_x.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   4974 Sep 17 23:31 bad_cases_review_20260918.csv\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  12717 Sep 17 23:31 bad_cases_review_20260918.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   1007 Sep 17 23:32 collection_log.jsonl\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root    723 Sep 17 23:32 collection_report.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root    534 Sep 17 22:20 daily_brief_2026-09-17.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 131797 Sep 17 22:59 delivered_orders.csv\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   1021 Sep 17 22:50 delivered_orders.sql\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 124621 Sep 17 22:58 delivered_orders_20260918.csv\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   2963 Sep 17 23:32 quarantine.jsonl\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   3447 Sep 17 23:36 wechat_ocr_reconcile_20260918.csv\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  10085 Sep 17 23:38 wechat_ocr_reconcile_20260918.md\n\ndatahub/scripts:\ntotal 40\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 Sep 17 22:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root 4096 Sep 17 21:31 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1890 Sep 17 21:31 calc.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 7953 Sep 17 21:31 collect.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 6916 Sep 17 22:19 daily_brief.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 4122 Sep 17 21:31 kb_search.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 2844 Sep 17 21:31 query.py\n--- snapshot ---\nconfig_key | config_value | description\n----------------------------------------\nsnapshot_at | 2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00 | 固定模拟时点，不读取系统当前时间\nbusiness_timezone | Asia/Shanghai | 中国业务时间；UTC+08:00\ndaily_brief_hour | 08:00 | 统计上一个完整自然日，异常存量截至前一日23:59:59\norder_completion_basis | 全量签收 | 分批发货、部分签收均不算订单完成\nrisk_red_threshold | 0.65 | 演示概率>=0.65红\nrisk_yellow_threshold | 0.3 | 0.30<=演示概率<0.65黄，其余绿\nnode_red_grace_hours | 0 | 计划结束已到但未完成的节点标红\nexception_event_grace_hours | 4 | 额外超过4小时创建节点异常事件\nrisk_min_samples | 5 | 不足时回退样本池，条件尾部不足时标记外推\nrisk_simulation_trials | 512 | 固定随机种子，拉普拉斯平滑；不是经真实数据校准的概率\ntrend_ma_window | 7 | 工作中心用有作业日，企业实物产量用自然日\ntrend_slope_window | 14 | 线性回归斜率\ntrend_decline_threshold | -0.1 | 移动平均环比跌幅超过10%且斜率<0\ncurrency | CNY | 模拟人民币；不涉及真实汇率\nopening_inventory | 0 | 模拟各批次期初库存为0；各批次先入后出\nmock_seed | 20260918 | 确定性生成，不代表客户真实经营情况\nproduction_calendar | 周一至周六 | 演示工作日历，不套用真实法定节假日\nerp_poll_seconds | 60 | 仅Mock配置，无真实连接\nsource_lookup_key | sales_order_id/work_order_id | 合同编号不保证唯一；禁止仅用合同编号跨表JOIN\nsource_risk_usage | 仅保留原始标记 | 不可当作实际延期标签或预测答案\n(20 rows)", "id": "a7f7573bad3645d498f99d0e350db56f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:31.220449", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:31.221454", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "There's already a `daily_brief.py` script in datahub/scripts (modified at 22:19) and a `daily_brief_2026-09-17.md` output. Let me look at that script — it may have been written in a previous session. Let me also read the existing brief for format.\n\nNote: daily_brief_2026-09-17.md exists — that was probably for the 2026-09-17 08:00 brief (covering 2026-09-16). Now the user wants the 2026-09-18 08:00 brief, covering 2026-09-17.\n\nLet me read the script and existing output.\n", "id": "ee4b19756cb74ffdac59c6a4b63971f6", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:32.249997", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_35d5b27a6ee54295a0c3fe60", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/scripts/daily_brief.py\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:34.164894", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_a9ff6979697d4b2493bd1b13", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/output/daily_brief_2026-09-17.md\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:34.514826", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_35d5b27a6ee54295a0c3fe60", "name": "read_file", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"每日经营简报（前一自然日）生成 + Mock推送\n口径: 完成=全量签收; 新增异常工单=当日 opened 的工单去重; 日末未关闭=日末时点仍开放(opened<=EOD 且 未关闭或关闭时间>EOD)的工单去重; 报销按 submitted_at 当日去重.\n用法: python3 daily_brief.py [--db PATH] [--date YYYY-MM-DD] [--no-push]\n默认报告日 = 快照日期的前一天; 推送 Mock: http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sqlite3\nimport sys\nimport urllib.request\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\n\nMOCK_PUSH = \"http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push\"\n\n\ndef find_db(explicit=None):\n    here = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n    cands = [explicit] if explicit else []\n    cands += [\n        os.path.join(here, \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"datahub\", \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        \"/data/actions/zhizaoyun-datahub/agent_data.sqlite\",\n    ]\n    for c in cands:\n        if c and os.path.isfile(c):\n            return c\n    raise SystemExit(\"agent_data.sqlite not found\")\n\n\ndef out_dir():\n    cands = [os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"datahub\", \"output\"),\n             os.path.join(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)), \"output\"),\n             \"/data/actions/zhizaoyun-datahub/output\"]\n    for c in cands:\n        try:\n            os.makedirs(c, exist_ok=True)\n            return c\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n    return \".\"\n\n\ndef run(db, report_day=None):\n    con = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{db}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\n    q = lambda s, *a: con.execute(s, a).fetchall()\n    snap = q(\"SELECT config_value FROM configuration WHERE config_key='snapshot_at'\")[0][0]\n    if not report_day:\n        snap_date = snap[:10]\n        report_day = (datetime.strptime(snap_date, \"%Y-%m-%d\") - timedelta(days=1)).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n    D = report_day\n    EOD = D + \"T23:59:59+08:00\"\n\n    completed = q(\"\"\"\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, MAX(received_at) last_at, COUNT(*) batches,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed\n       FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\nSELECT sales_order_id, last_at FROM lr WHERE signed=batches AND last_at LIKE ? || '%'\"\"\", D)\n    new_wo = q(\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at LIKE ? || '%'\", D)[0][0]\n    open_wo = q(\"\"\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) FROM exceptions\nWHERE opened_at<=? AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>?)\"\"\", EOD, EOD)[0][0]\n    reimb = q(\"SELECT COUNT(*), ROUND(COALESCE(SUM(amount),0),2) FROM expenses WHERE submitted_at LIKE ? || '%'\", D)[0]\n\n    unfinished = q(\"\"\"\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed\n       FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\nSELECT\n SUM(CASE WHEN s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed < s.batches THEN 1 ELSE 0 END),\n SUM(CASE WHEN (s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed < s.batches) AND o.promised_delivery_at < ? THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)\nFROM v_current_orders o LEFT JOIN lr s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\nWHERE (s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed < s.batches)\"\"\", snap)[0]\n\n    eff = q(\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM v_current_orders\")[0][0]\n    done = q(\"\"\"\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed\n       FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM v_current_orders o JOIN lr s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id WHERE s.signed=s.batches\"\"\")[0][0]\n\n    # WC02 人效（近7有作业日 vs 前7）\n    eff_rows = q(\"\"\"SELECT work_date, SUM(earned_standard_hours), SUM(actual_hours)\nFROM labor_logs WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' GROUP BY work_date ORDER BY work_date\"\"\")\n    series = [se / sa for wd, se, sa in eff_rows if sa]\n    mean = lambda xs: sum(xs) / len(xs) if xs else 0.0\n    r7, p7 = mean(series[-7:]), mean(series[-14:-7])\n    chg = (r7 / p7 - 1) * 100 if p7 else 0.0\n    con.close()\n\n    lines = [\n        \"【模拟经营日报｜%s】\" % D,\n        \"· 全量交付 %d 单（完成=全部批次签收）\" % len(completed),\n        \"· 新增异常工单 %d 单；日末未关闭异常工单 %d 单（工单去重）\" % (new_wo, open_wo),\n        \"· 报销提交 %d 笔，金额 %.2f 元\" % (reimb[0], reimb[1]),\n        \"· 当前未全量交付 %d 单（其中已逾期 %d 单）；已生效订单 %d 单、累计全量签收 %d 单\" % (unfinished[0], unfinished[1], eff, done),\n        \"· 加工二组WC02人效近7个有作业日均值 %.6f，较前7日 %.6f 变化 %.2f%%（下降需结合设备停机日志核查）\" % (r7, p7, chg),\n    ]\n    brief = \"\\n\".join(lines)\n    if completed:\n        brief += \"\\n· 当日完成订单：\" + \"、\".join(r[0] for r in completed)\n    result = {\n        \"report_date\": D, \"snapshot_at\": snap,\n        \"completed_orders\": len(completed), \"completed_list\": [r[0] for r in completed],\n        \"new_abnormal_work_orders\": new_wo, \"open_abnormal_work_orders_eod\": open_wo,\n        \"reimbursement_count\": reimb[0], \"reimbursement_amount\": reimb[1],\n        \"unfinished_orders\": unfinished[0], \"overdue_unfinished\": unfinished[1],\n        \"effective_orders\": eff, \"completed_total\": done,\n        \"wc02_recent7\": round(r7, 6), \"wc02_prev7\": round(p7, 6), \"wc02_change_pct\": round(chg, 2),\n        \"brief\": brief,\n    }\n    return result\n\n\ndef push(result, date_key):\n    body = {\n        \"idempotency_key\": \"daily-brief-%s\" % date_key,\n        \"recipient_group\": \"MOCK_MANAGEMENT\",\n        \"content\": result[\"brief\"],\n    }\n    req = urllib.request.Request(MOCK_PUSH, data=json.dumps(body, ensure_ascii=False).encode(\"utf-8\"),\n                                 headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}, method=\"POST\")\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=20) as resp:\n        return json.loads(resp.read().decode(\"utf-8\"))\n\n\ndef main():\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"--db\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--date\", help=\"报告日 YYYY-MM-DD（默认=快照日前一天）\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--no-push\", action=\"store_true\")\n    args = ap.parse_args()\n    db = find_db(args.db)\n    result = run(db, args.date)\n\n    d = out_dir()\n    md = os.path.join(d, \"daily_brief_%s.md\" % result[\"report_date\"])\n    with open(md, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(result[\"brief\"] + \"\\n\")\n    result[\"saved_to\"] = md\n\n    if not args.no_push:\n        try:\n            result[\"push\"] = push(result, result[\"report_date\"].replace(\"-\", \"\"))\n        except Exception as e:\n            result[\"push\"] = {\"error\": str(e)}\n    print(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n", "id": "edd6f3fa1ee845d2a44c9fc6af42033b", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:34.769932", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:34.771808", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_a9ff6979697d4b2493bd1b13", "name": "read_file", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "【模拟经营日报｜2026-09-17】\n· 全量交付 2 单（完成=全部批次签收）\n· 新增异常工单 9 单；日末未关闭异常工单 20 单（工单去重）\n· 报销提交 2 笔，金额 3943.27 元\n· 当前未全量交付 89 单（其中已逾期 12 单）；已生效订单 769 单、累计全量签收 680 单\n· 加工二组WC02人效近7个有作业日均值 0.469421，较前7日 0.676167 变化 -30.58%（下降需结合设备停机日志核查）\n· 当日完成订单：SO20260814-00447、SO20260815-00741\n", "id": "11f324b8185e460ba648016feb7eda79", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:34.770054", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:34.774535", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "There's an existing daily_brief.py from a previous session. It references `v_current_orders` view — let me check whether that exists (the sqlite_master table list didn't show views... actually the query was type='table' only). Let me check views.\n\nNote the existing brief file is named daily_brief_2026-09-17.md — that's the report day 2026-09-17, which was generated presumably when snapshot was 2026-09-18? Wait, the script default report_day = snapshot date - 1 = 2026-09-17. So the existing file IS the 2026-09-18 08:00 brief content (report day 2026-09-17). Hmm, but it was created at 22:20 on Sep 17 — likely a previous run.\n\nWait, but careful: the previous session may have run with --date 2026-09-16? No, the file says 2026-09-17.\n\nSo actually the existing file already covers report day 2026-09-17, which is exactly what the 2026-09-18 08:00 brief should cover. But I should verify by re-running and cross-checking numbers with my own SQL, and produce a proper one-page brief with evidence.\n\nLet me be careful about correctness issues in the existing script:\n1. `completed` uses `last_at LIKE D || '%'` on shipments.received_at — full signature completion determined by signed=batches AND last received date on D. OK.\n2. `unfinished` counts: the WHERE clause plus CASE is redundant but fine. But it uses `o.promised_delivery_at < snap` — string comparison of ISO timestamps; promised_delivery_at format? Need to check. Also \"已逾期\" should mean promised date passed and not fully signed.\n3. It uses v_current_orders — need to check it exists and its definition (probably effective orders excluding future samples).\n\nLet me check views and column formats. Also I should verify the numbers independently with query.py, and check exceptions semantics (opened_at/closed_at, work_order_id), expenses (submitted_at, amount), and whether \"报销笔数\" should come from expenses table or oa_forms (口径 says 报销提交量按报销单号去重). The script uses COUNT(*) on expenses — should be COUNT(DISTINCT expense_id or reimbursement no). Let me check schema.\n\nLet me run several checks.", "id": "87aeac9bf9924034a3d5d96db63004eb", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:36.167248", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_ef88ee92bd7e472082359975", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT name, sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='view'\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:43.238594", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_2a8b6167db65403e8fb859b0", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(exceptions)\\\" && echo \\\"=== expenses ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(expenses)\\\" && echo \\\"=== shipments ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(shipments)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:43.640972", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_ef88ee92bd7e472082359975", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "name | sql\n----------------------------------------\nv_current_orders | CREATE VIEW v_current_orders AS SELECT * FROM orders WHERE is_effective=1 AND created_at <= (SELECT config_value FROM configuration WHERE config_key='snapshot_at')\nv_inventory_balance | CREATE VIEW v_inventory_balance AS SELECT warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id,unit,SUM(signed_quantity) AS quantity_balance FROM wms_transactions GROUP BY warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id,unit\n(2 rows)", "id": "452bdeac1a994363865918f1ea4f249d", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:44.299474", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:44.300511", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_2a8b6167db65403e8fb859b0", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | exception_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | exception_type | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | severity | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | opened_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | closed_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | status | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | reason | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | source_record_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(10 rows)\n=== expenses ===\ncid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | expense_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | employee_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | department_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | expense_type | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | amount | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n6 | currency | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | submitted_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | approved_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | paid_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n10 | status | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n11 | invoice_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(12 rows)\n=== shipments ===\ncid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | shipment_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | route_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | carrier | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | tracking_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | quantity | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n7 | unit | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | dispatched_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | carrier_promised_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n10 | received_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n11 | freight_cost | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n12 | status | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(13 rows)", "id": "a0d544c8a10c4df9aa7297ca5a930b14", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:44.358170", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:44.359397", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good. Now let me verify key data formats and run independent SQL checks for report day 2026-09-17.\n\nChecks:\n1. shipments.received_at format sample, status values.\n2. exceptions.opened_at format, status values, work_order_id nulls.\n3. expenses.submitted_at format; count distinct expense_id vs rows; amount sum.\n4. Completed orders on 2026-09-17 (full signature).\n5. Overdue count.\n\nLet me run these.", "id": "a9b4c24898a64569b642e5d052041a12", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:46.095987", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_99d6f674c2b24949bc7b7a39", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT status, COUNT(*) FROM shipments GROUP BY status\\\" && echo \\\"=== received_at sample ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT shipment_id, sales_order_id, received_at, status FROM shipments WHERE received_at LIKE '2026-09-17%' LIMIT 5\\\" && echo \\\"=== exceptions status ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT status, COUNT(*) FROM exceptions GROUP BY status\\\" && echo \\\"=== exc sample ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT exception_id, work_order_id, opened_at, closed_at, status FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at LIKE '2026-09-17%' LIMIT 5\\\" && echo \\\"=== expenses sample ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT expense_id, submitted_at, amount, status FROM expenses WHERE submitted_at LIKE '2026-09-17%' LIMIT 5\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:47.709139", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_99d6f674c2b24949bc7b7a39", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "status | COUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n在途 | 22\n已签收 | 724\n(2 rows)\n=== received_at sample ===\nshipment_id | sales_order_id | received_at | status\n----------------------------------------\nSH-MO20260814-00447-1 | SO20260814-00447 | 2026-09-17T08:24:57+08:00 | 已签收\nSH-MO20260815-00741-1 | SO20260815-00741 | 2026-09-17T19:20:28+08:00 | 已签收\n(2 rows)\n=== exceptions status ===\nstatus | COUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n处理中 | 24\n已关闭 | 2325\n(2 rows)\n=== exc sample ===\nexception_id | work_order_id | opened_at | closed_at | status\n----------------------------------------\nEXM00576 | MO20260728-0181 | 2026-09-17T17:30:04+08:00 |  | 处理中\nEXM00627 | MO20260813-0194 | 2026-09-17T09:11:14+08:00 |  | 处理中\nEXM00650 | MO20260812-00223 | 2026-09-17T18:24:00+08:00 | 2026-09-17T22:20:59+08:00 | 已关闭\nEXM00879 | MO20260822-00303 | 2026-09-17T07:12:00+08:00 |  | 处理中\nEXM01196 | MO20260825-00401 | 2026-09-17T10:24:00+08:00 | 2026-09-18T06:51:42+08:00 | 已关闭\n(5 rows)\n=== expenses sample ===\nexpense_id | submitted_at | amount | status\n----------------------------------------\nREIM00174 | 2026-09-17T14:00:00+08:00 | 1041.83 | 审批中\nREIM00465 | 2026-09-17T09:00:00+08:00 | 2901.44 | 审批中\n(2 rows)", "id": "1bf65b90580648acb6096e4d2ad5c6e5", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:50.671760", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:50.677294", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Interesting: EXM01196 opened 2026-09-17T10:24, closed 2026-09-18T06:51:42 — closed AFTER the report EOD (2026-09-17T23:59:59) but before snapshot. So for \"日末未关闭\" it counts as open at EOD — correct per the script's logic (closed_at > EOD). Good.\n\nNote: the script's `open_wo` counts DISTINCT work_order_id where opened_at <= EOD and (closed_at null or > EOD). That's \"日末未关闭异常工单数\" — work order dedup. Good per 口径.\n\nNow let me independently verify all numbers with SQL, and also check a subtlety: \"新增异常工单数\" = distinct work_order_id with opened_at on day D. And \"异常事件条数\" = count of exception rows on day D. The 口径 says three metrics strictly distinguished: 异常事件条数 / 新增异常工单数 / 日末未关闭异常工单数. A good brief should report all three (or at least the two required + events).\n\nAlso check: are there exceptions with work_order_id NULL? Let me verify.\n\nAlso verify completed orders: full signature = all batches signed. Let me check with quantity-based logic too: 订单完成 = 全量签收, comparing sum of signed quantity vs order quantity. The script uses batches-based (signed=batches). Better: check quantity. Let me look at orders table columns for quantity.\n\nLet me run a comprehensive verification.", "id": "922a7757f079445193567de48e1f43a3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:54.174974", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_4df3536fc4ea44ea9c9e9d50", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(orders)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:58.912285", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_503d7fe1fbe3461ea3bc68c1", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && echo \\\"=== exc null wo ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) n FROM exceptions WHERE work_order_id IS NULL OR work_order_id=''\\\" && echo \\\"=== D events vs workorders ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) events, COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) wos FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\" && echo \\\"=== open at EOD ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00')\\\" && echo \\\"=== expenses dedup ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) rows, COUNT(DISTINCT expense_id) ids, ROUND(SUM(amount),2) amt FROM expenses WHERE submitted_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:43:59.755775", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_4df3536fc4ea44ea9c9e9d50", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | order_line_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | contract_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | customer_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | product_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | packaged_goods | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | quantity | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n8 | unit | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | contract_amount | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n10 | created_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n11 | promised_delivery_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n12 | delivery_basis | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n13 | route_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n14 | fulfillment_mode | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n15 | order_source | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n16 | source_risk_flag | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n17 | source_risk_reason | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n18 | sales_owner | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n19 | source_sheet | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n20 | source_row | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n21 | is_effective | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n22 | data_origin | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n23 | snapshot_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(24 rows)", "id": "4d51b256746745ae9403e56325d93d9f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:02.709052", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:02.710568", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_503d7fe1fbe3461ea3bc68c1", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "=== exc null wo ===\nn\n----------------------------------------\n0\n(1 rows)\n=== D events vs workorders ===\nevents | wos\n----------------------------------------\n9 | 9\n(1 rows)\n=== open at EOD ===\nCOUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id)\n----------------------------------------\n20\n(1 rows)\n=== expenses dedup ===\nrows | ids | amt\n----------------------------------------\n2 | 2 | 3943.27\n(1 rows)", "id": "412f603e0996472f994a958407d4f0b4", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:02.802108", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:02.803344", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Confirmed: 9 events / 9 work orders new; 20 open at EOD; 2 reimbursements totaling 3943.27 CNY.\n\nNow verify completed orders on 2026-09-17 with both batch-count and quantity basis (全量签收 = signed quantity == order quantity).\n\nLet me compute:\n- orders with all shipments 已签收 and last received_at on 2026-09-17.\n- Also quantity check: SUM(signed quantity) vs orders.quantity.\n\nAlso check whether any order has shipments where quantity sum < order quantity (partial). Let me do a thorough query.", "id": "0654234437ba431f9edc3f3c3da76493", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:04.567828", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_2188b8d610564b4f891f5e71", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && cat > datahub/output/_brief_check.sql <<'SQL'\\n-- A. 全量签收判定（批次口径 vs 数量口径）交叉验证\\nWITH s AS (\\n  SELECT sales_order_id,\\n         COUNT(*) batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) signed_qty,\\n         MAX(received_at) last_received_at\\n  FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT o.sales_order_id, o.quantity, s.batches, s.signed_batches, s.signed_qty, s.last_received_at,\\n       CASE WHEN s.signed_batches=s.batches AND s.signed_qty>=o.quantity THEN 'FULL' ELSE 'PART' END basis\\nFROM v_current_orders o JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE s.last_received_at LIKE '2026-09-17%';\\nSQL\\npython3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"$(cat datahub/output/_brief_check.sql)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:06.314859", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_2188b8d610564b4f891f5e71", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "Command failed with exit code 1.\n[stderr]\nERROR: only read-only SELECT/PRAGMA allowed", "id": "1f4b1722938e4b8b963dd082a9b96a0c", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:09.368175", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:09.369779", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The query.py probably strips leading comments or requires the string to start with SELECT. Let me check query.py.\n", "id": "fe5a6eb2f4404dd498db176c36165f12", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:10.495457", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_9b2af33b1f3249ffa575f6d3", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/scripts/query.py\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:10.896876", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_9b2af33b1f3249ffa575f6d3", "name": "read_file", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"只读 SQL 查询 agent_data.sqlite（金汉隆数据中枢直读库）\n\n用法:\n  python3 datahub/query.py \"SELECT count(*) FROM orders WHERE is_effective=1\"\n  python3 datahub/query.py --json \"SELECT ...\"     # JSON 输出（默认表格）\n  python3 datahub/query.py --db /path/agent_data.sqlite \"SELECT ...\"\n  echo \"SELECT ...\" | python3 datahub/query.py\n\n说明: 只读连接（mode=ro），默认最多返回 200 行；写操作会报错（库本身只读）。\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sqlite3\nimport sys\n\n\ndef find_db(explicit=None):\n    cands = []\n    if explicit:\n        cands.append(explicit)\n    if os.environ.get(\"DATAHUB_DB\"):\n        cands.append(os.environ[\"DATAHUB_DB\"])\n    here = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n    cands += [\n        os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"datahub\", \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        os.path.join(here, \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        \"/data/actions/zhizaoyun-datahub/agent_data.sqlite\",\n    ]\n    for c in cands:\n        if c and os.path.isfile(c):\n            return c\n    return None\n\n\ndef main():\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"sql\", nargs=\"?\", help=\"SQL 语句（SELECT/PRAGMA；留空则从 stdin 读）\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--db\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--limit\", type=int, default=200)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--json\", action=\"store_true\")\n    args = ap.parse_args()\n\n    sql = args.sql or sys.stdin.read()\n    sql = sql.strip().rstrip(\";\").strip()\n    if not sql:\n        print(\"ERROR: empty sql\", file=sys.stderr)\n        sys.exit(1)\n    low = sql.lower().lstrip()\n    if not (low.startswith(\"select\") or low.startswith(\"with\") or low.startswith(\"pragma\")):\n        print(\"ERROR: only read-only SELECT/PRAGMA allowed\", file=sys.stderr)\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    db = find_db(args.db)\n    if not db:\n        print(\"ERROR: agent_data.sqlite not found (use --db or set DATAHUB_DB)\", file=sys.stderr)\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    con = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{db}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\n    con.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\n    try:\n        cur = con.execute(sql)\n        rows = [dict(r) for r in cur.fetchmany(args.limit)]\n        cols = [d[0] for d in cur.description] if cur.description else []\n    except sqlite3.Error as exc:\n        print(f\"SQL ERROR: {exc}\", file=sys.stderr)\n        sys.exit(1)\n    finally:\n        con.close()\n\n    if args.json:\n        print(json.dumps({\"columns\": cols, \"rows\": rows, \"row_count\": len(rows)},\n                         ensure_ascii=False, default=str, indent=1))\n    else:\n        print(\" | \".join(cols))\n        print(\"-\" * 40)\n        for r in rows:\n            print(\" | \".join(\"\" if r[c] is None else str(r[c]) for c in cols))\n        print(f\"({len(rows)} rows)\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n", "id": "0377b252978a45e4aa1613fc8982fd39", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:11.005168", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:11.006163", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The leading `--` comment blocked it. Just remove leading comments.\n", "id": "37e89c118dc343229e84c400c4d5ac15", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:13.754744", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_cde8396815ce48a995070154", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (\\n  SELECT sales_order_id,\\n         COUNT(*) batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) signed_qty,\\n         MAX(received_at) last_received_at\\n  FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT o.sales_order_id, o.quantity, o.unit, s.batches, s.signed_batches, s.signed_qty, s.last_received_at,\\n       CASE WHEN s.signed_batches=s.batches AND s.signed_qty>=o.quantity THEN 'FULL' ELSE 'PART' END basis\\nFROM v_current_orders o JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE s.last_received_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:14.148307", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_7955650da18546b09b7ca9e4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (\\n  SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) signed_qty,\\n    MAX(received_at) last_received_at\\n  FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT COUNT(*) effective,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN s.signed_batches=s.batches AND s.signed_qty>=o.quantity THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) full_signed,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN s.sales_order_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) no_shipment,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN s.sales_order_id IS NOT NULL AND (s.signed_batches<s.batches OR s.signed_qty<o.quantity) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) partial,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed_batches<s.batches OR s.signed_qty<o.quantity THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) not_done,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN (s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed_batches<s.batches OR s.signed_qty<o.quantity) AND o.promised_delivery_at < '2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) overdue\\nFROM v_current_orders o LEFT JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:17.312628", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_cde8396815ce48a995070154", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "sales_order_id | quantity | unit | batches | signed_batches | signed_qty | last_received_at | basis\n----------------------------------------\nSO20260814-00447 | 1 | 台 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 2026-09-17T08:24:57+08:00 | FULL\nSO20260815-00741 | 3 | 台 | 1 | 1 | 3 | 2026-09-17T19:20:28+08:00 | FULL\n(2 rows)", "id": "551155d5c02f456a8b3db6d04fbdacc6", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:21.796540", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:21.798270", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_7955650da18546b09b7ca9e4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "effective | full_signed | no_shipment | partial | not_done | overdue\n----------------------------------------\n769 | 680 | 67 | 22 | 89 | 12\n(1 rows)", "id": "f5dbe6861725412e99db5abf94093c9e", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:21.805381", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:21.806364", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Numbers match the existing script: 769 effective, 680 fully signed, 89 not done, 12 overdue.\n\nNow let me also gather a bit more for a good one-page brief:\n- 前一自然日 (2026-09-17) 发货批次/在途\n- 当日新增异常明细 (types/severity) — brief mention\n- 逾期 12 单 list? Maybe top few with promised dates.\n- WC02 人效 trend — the script includes it. Should I include? 需求5 brief is: 前一自然日交付订单量、新增/未关闭异常工单、报销笔数与金额. The extra context lines are fine.\n\nLet me also check the labor_logs based 人效 numbers and verify. And check whether there's a broader \"全厂人效\" that might be better. The prior session's brief used WC02. Let me verify the series computation independently.\n\nActually let me compute company-wide 人效 (all workcenters) last 7 working days vs prior 7, plus WC02. Hmm, keep it simple but verify.\n\nLet me check labor_logs schema and compute.", "id": "b99eacc4b6aa4cdbbf32f9e4514fdbda", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:24.790495", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_92d4a72b81b346478f7dc57d", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(labor_logs)\\\" && echo \\\"=== wc list ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT workcenter_id, COUNT(*) rows, MIN(work_date) mn, MAX(work_date) mx FROM labor_logs GROUP BY workcenter_id\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:29.500920", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_5afbbf36bde44e8b847ba6a8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT work_date, SUM(earned_standard_hours) earned, SUM(actual_hours) actual, ROUND(SUM(earned_standard_hours)/SUM(actual_hours),6) eff FROM labor_logs WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' GROUP BY work_date ORDER BY work_date DESC LIMIT 16\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:31.387881", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_5afbbf36bde44e8b847ba6a8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "work_date | earned | actual | eff\n----------------------------------------\n2026-09-17 | 28.9758 | 71.4874 | 0.405327\n2026-09-16 | 30.7143 | 73.6526 | 0.417016\n2026-09-15 | 30.0507 | 71.8658 | 0.41815\n2026-09-14 | 32.2049 | 71.0 | 0.45359\n2026-09-12 | 32.4307 | 65.0 | 0.498934\n2026-09-11 | 34.5024 | 64.7312 | 0.53301\n2026-09-10 | 34.4352 | 61.5 | 0.559922\n2026-09-09 | 31.1081 | 53.5 | 0.58146\n2026-09-08 | 30.045 | 49.0 | 0.613163\n2026-09-07 | 35.7666 | 57.0 | 0.627484\n2026-09-05 | 35.6499 | 52.25 | 0.682295\n2026-09-04 | 39.3645 | 54.5 | 0.722284\n2026-09-03 | 35.1566 | 46.5 | 0.756056\n2026-09-02 | 30.8779 | 41.1473 | 0.750423\n2026-09-01 | 37.153 | 46.75 | 0.794717\n2026-08-31 | 39.9248 | 49.0 | 0.814792\n(16 rows)", "id": "57a2db019ff5463da49853dd61b25083", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:33.250932", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:33.252421", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_92d4a72b81b346478f7dc57d", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | labor_log_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | work_date | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | employee_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | department_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | workcenter_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | stage_code | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | actual_hours | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n9 | earned_standard_hours | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n10 | hourly_rate | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n11 | standard_value_rate | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n12 | reported_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n13 | approved | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n(14 rows)\n=== wc list ===\nworkcenter_id | rows | mn | mx\n----------------------------------------\nWC01 | 3969 | 2025-12-03 | 2026-09-17\nWC02 | 4455 | 2025-12-02 | 2026-09-17\nWC03 | 1918 | 2025-12-18 | 2026-09-17\nWC04 | 2092 | 2025-12-16 | 2026-09-17\n(4 rows)", "id": "52749bf9652947d9bdac8db26bdd83f0", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:33.279695", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:33.280875", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "WC02 last 7 working days: 09-10..09-17 (7 points: 09-10,09-11,09-12,09-14,09-15,09-16,09-17) mean = ?\n\nLet me compute with calc.py: 0.559922,0.53301,0.498934,0.45359,0.41815,0.417016,0.405327 → mean.\nPrev 7: 09-01..09-09: 0.794717,0.750423,0.756056,0.722284,0.682295,0.627484,0.613163,0.58146 — that's 8. Wait prev 7 points = the 7 before the last 7: 09-09,09-08,09-07,09-05,09-04,09-03,09-02 → 0.58146,0.613163,0.627484,0.682295,0.722284,0.756056,0.750423.\n\nNote the script computes mean of per-day ratios (ratio of sums per day, then mean of ratios) — that's \"近7个点均值\" of the daily 人效 series. OK, consistent with trend 口径 (7-point moving average of the daily series).\n\nLet me verify with calc.py and also compute 14-point regression slope to apply the decline rule properly (下降超过10% AND slope<0).\n\nAlso note 09-13 missing (Sunday? 2026-09-13 is a Sunday). Production calendar 周一至周六. Good.\n\nLet me run calc.py.", "id": "236f3920fe3a44f797c7f25be58a2d4e", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:34.801130", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_46e53456c0c44aa28911c557", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/calc.py 0.559922,0.533010,0.498934,0.453590,0.418150,0.417016,0.405327 && echo \\\"--- prev7 ---\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/calc.py 0.581460,0.613163,0.627484,0.682295,0.722284,0.756056,0.750423 && echo \\\"--- 14pt slope ---\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/calc.py 0.750423,0.756056,0.722284,0.682295,0.627484,0.613163,0.581460,0.559922,0.533010,0.498934,0.453590,0.418150,0.417016,0.405327\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:41.480520", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_46e53456c0c44aa28911c557", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"n\": 7, \"mean\": 0.469421, \"first\": 0.559922, \"last\": 0.405327, \"change_rate\": -0.276101, \"slope\": -0.027734}\n--- prev7 ---\n{\"n\": 7, \"mean\": 0.676166, \"first\": 0.58146, \"last\": 0.750423, \"change_rate\": 0.290584, \"slope\": 0.031696}\n--- 14pt slope ---\n{\"n\": 14, \"mean\": 0.572794, \"first\": 0.750423, \"last\": 0.405327, \"change_rate\": -0.459869, \"slope\": -0.029579}", "id": "357d866a946943229b9304f59fb216af", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:45.554538", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:45.556109", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Confirmed: WC02 recent-7 mean 0.469421 vs prev-7 0.676166 → change = 0.469421/0.676166 - 1 = -30.58%. 14-point slope = -0.029579 < 0. So decline rule triggered (下降 >10% AND slope<0).\n\nNow let me gather supporting evidence for the decline: equipment alarms / downtime / mes_events around 2026-09-10..09-17 for WC02. The 口径 says don't assert cause from curve alone; check equipment alarms, downtime, and 报工 records. Let me look for supporting evidence quickly (this is a trend hint, optional in brief but good).\n\nAlso for the brief I want:\n- 当日发货批次/在途存量\n- 新增异常明细类型分布\n- 逾期12单清单（订单号+承诺交期）— key facts\n- 报销笔数金额\n\nLet me query these.", "id": "5339fdb7f6a84557b4d43eafb3b16769", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:49.827776", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_18a9ec2e5ec14de6b8654232", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) dispatched_0917 FROM shipments WHERE dispatched_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\" && echo \\\"=== 在途 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) in_transit, SUM(quantity) qty FROM shipments WHERE status='在途'\\\" && echo \\\"=== 新增异常类型 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT exception_type, severity, COUNT(*) n FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at LIKE '2026-09-17%' GROUP BY exception_type, severity ORDER BY n DESC\\\" && echo \\\"=== 日末未关闭异常明细 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT work_order_id, sales_order_id, exception_type, severity, opened_at FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00') ORDER BY opened_at\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:52.038110", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_363ba85f2df5426196034313", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) signed_qty\\n    FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT o.sales_order_id, o.work_order_id, o.customer_id, o.product_id, o.quantity, o.unit, o.promised_delivery_at,\\n       COALESCE(s.signed_qty,0) signed_qty, ROUND((julianday('2026-09-18T08:00:00')-julianday(o.promised_delivery_at))*24,1) hours_over\\nFROM v_current_orders o LEFT JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE (s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed_batches<s.batches OR s.signed_qty<o.quantity)\\n  AND o.promised_delivery_at < '2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00'\\nORDER BY o.promised_delivery_at\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:54.359203", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_363ba85f2df5426196034313", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "sales_order_id | work_order_id | customer_id | product_id | quantity | unit | promised_delivery_at | signed_qty | hours_over\n----------------------------------------\nSO20260702-0176 | MO20260702-0176 | C0220 | P002 | 1 | 台 | 2026-08-01T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 1150.0\nSO20260728-0181 | MO20260728-0181 | C0197 | P001 | 3 | 台 | 2026-08-17T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 766.0\nSO20260807-00562 | MO20260807-00562 | C0198 | P013 | 3 | 件 | 2026-08-27T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 526.0\nSO20260808-00752 | MO20260808-00752 | C0199 | P002 | 3 | 台 | 2026-08-28T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 502.0\nSO20260814-0189 | MO20260814-0189 | C0167 | P012 | 2 | 件 | 2026-09-08T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 238.0\nSO20260722-0179 | MO20260722-0179 | C0198 | P003 | 2 | 台 | 2026-09-10T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 190.0\nSO20260812-00619 | MO20260812-00619 | C0182 | P014 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-11T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 166.0\nSO20260824-00596 | MO20260824-00596 | C0069 | P010 | 4 | 套 | 2026-09-13T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 118.0\nSO20260805-0182 | MO20260805-0182 | C0194 | P003 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-14T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 94.0\nSO20260825-00401 | MO20260825-00401 | C0044 | P002 | 2 | 台 | 2026-09-14T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 94.0\nSO20260826-00259 | MO20260826-00259 | C0166 | P002 | 2 | 台 | 2026-09-15T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 70.0\nSO20260818-0183 | MO20260818-0183 | C0059 | P014 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-17T18:00:00+08:00 | 0 | 22.0\n(12 rows)", "id": "a6d7a388ab26491c84ce379d8d1f5f4e", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:44:57.140035", 