\" && echo \\\"=== equipment ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(equipment)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:02.307063", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_b5f70d36c550409a925debdf", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | mes_event_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | equipment_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | workcenter_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | event_type | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | start_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | end_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | duration_minutes | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n9 | alarm_code | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n10 | energy_kwh | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n(11 rows)\n=== event types ===\nevent_type | n\n----------------------------------------\nDOWN | 896\nRUN | 8231\n(2 rows)\n=== equipment ===\ncid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | equipment_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | equipment_name | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | workcenter_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | rated_power_kw | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n4 | overhead_rate_per_hour | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n(5 rows)", "id": "bee38e92355840f4b86e0daf579f7d8e", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:03.433839", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:03.435555", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me check WC02 downtime minutes per day for last ~14 working days vs earlier, to see if downtime increased (supporting evidence, not cause assertion).\n\nAlso check attendance / actual hours increase: the 人效 dropped because earned hours fell and actual hours rose. Let me quantify: earned 7-day mean vs prev, actual hours mean.\n", "id": "6257951226e54f139aa1c52a97bcf0e3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:05.133082", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_7903951ae6084cb4a10134e9", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT work_date, ROUND(SUM(earned_standard_hours),2) earned, ROUND(SUM(actual_hours),2) actual,\\n       COUNT(DISTINCT employee_id) heads\\nFROM labor_logs WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND work_date>='2026-08-25' GROUP BY work_date ORDER BY work_date\\\" && echo \\\"=== WC02 DOWN minutes by week ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT CASE WHEN date(start_at)>='2026-09-10' THEN 'recent(09-10~09-17)' ELSE 'prev(09-01~09-09)' END win,\\n       COUNT(*) down_events, ROUND(SUM(duration_minutes),1) down_min\\nFROM mes_events WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND event_type='DOWN' AND date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-01' AND '2026-09-17'\\nGROUP BY win ORDER BY win\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:06.055849", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_7903951ae6084cb4a10134e9", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "work_date | earned | actual | heads\n----------------------------------------\n2026-08-25 | 29.69 | 29.75 | 10\n2026-08-26 | 31.42 | 32.5 | 9\n2026-08-27 | 29.48 | 32.0 | 9\n2026-08-28 | 34.85 | 40.25 | 9\n2026-08-29 | 36.78 | 42.0 | 9\n2026-08-31 | 39.92 | 49.0 | 9\n2026-09-01 | 37.15 | 46.75 | 9\n2026-09-02 | 30.88 | 41.15 | 9\n2026-09-03 | 35.16 | 46.5 | 9\n2026-09-04 | 39.36 | 54.5 | 9\n2026-09-05 | 35.65 | 52.25 | 10\n2026-09-07 | 35.77 | 57.0 | 10\n2026-09-08 | 30.05 | 49.0 | 10\n2026-09-09 | 31.11 | 53.5 | 10\n2026-09-10 | 34.44 | 61.5 | 10\n2026-09-11 | 34.5 | 64.73 | 10\n2026-09-12 | 32.43 | 65.0 | 10\n2026-09-14 | 32.2 | 71.0 | 10\n2026-09-15 | 30.05 | 71.87 | 10\n2026-09-16 | 30.71 | 73.65 | 10\n2026-09-17 | 28.98 | 71.49 | 10\n(21 rows)\n=== WC02 DOWN minutes by week ===\nwin | down_events | down_min\n----------------------------------------\nprev(09-01~09-09) | 135 | 4049.2\nrecent(09-10~09-17) | 156 | 4680.0\n(2 rows)", "id": "6c945e6b2db944b981de65e24a6abc75", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:08.229238", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:08.230277", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "So the 人效 drop is driven by: actual hours up (49→71 avg) with earned standard hours roughly flat/slightly down (35→32), heads 9→10, and DOWN minutes up ~15.6% (4049→4680 over similar-length windows; prev window 09-01~09-09 is 7 working days, recent 09-10~09-17 is 7 working days: 09-10,11,12,14,15,16,17 — yes 7 each). Good — factual supporting evidence, not a cause claim.\n\nLet me compute per-day averages: prev actual mean = (46.75+41.15+46.5+54.5+52.25+57+49+53.5)... wait 09-01..09-09 working days: 09-01,02,03,04,05,07,08,09 = 8 days. Hmm 09-06 is Saturday? Let's check: 2026-09-05 is Saturday? Let me compute: 2026-09-17 is Thursday (given current date says Thursday 2026-09-17). So 09-14 Monday, 09-13 Sunday, 09-12 Saturday, 09-11 Friday, 09-10 Thursday, 09-09 Wednesday, 09-08 Tuesday, 09-07 Monday, 09-06 Sunday (no data ✓), 09-05 Saturday, 09-04 Friday, 09-03 Thursday, 09-02 Wednesday, 09-01 Tuesday. So prev window 09-01~09-09 = 8 working days, recent 09-10~09-17 = 7 working days (10,11,12,14,15,16,17).\n\nFor the DOWN comparison, better to use the exact 14 working days used in the trend: recent 7 = 09-10..09-17; prev 7 = 09-02..09-09 (09-02,03,04,05,07,08,09). Let me redo with those exact dates to be precise.\n\nLet me compute down minutes for prev 7 working days (09-02..09-09) and recent 7 (09-10..09-17).\n\nAlso compute mean actual hours and earned hours for both windows to state the driver factually.\n\nLet me do it in one query.", "id": "f8d71d72eaac43ac978161c7453cce94", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:09.782013", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_b8816c63aeb849699a1a330a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH d(dt,win) AS (VALUES\\n ('2026-09-02','prev7'),('2026-09-03','prev7'),('2026-09-04','prev7'),('2026-09-05','prev7'),('2026-09-07','prev7'),('2026-09-08','prev7'),('2026-09-09','prev7'),\\n ('2026-09-10','recent7'),('2026-09-11','recent7'),('2026-09-12','recent7'),('2026-09-14','recent7'),('2026-09-15','recent7'),('2026-09-16','recent7'),('2026-09-17','recent7'))\\nSELECT win, COUNT(DISTINCT dt) days, ROUND(SUM(earned_standard_hours)/COUNT(DISTINCT dt),2) earned_per_day,\\n       ROUND(SUM(actual_hours)/COUNT(DISTINCT dt),2) actual_per_day, COUNT(DISTINCT employee_id) heads\\nFROM labor_logs JOIN d ON d.dt=work_date WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' GROUP BY win ORDER BY win DESC\\\" && echo \\\"=== DOWN same windows ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT CASE WHEN date(start_at)<='2026-09-09' THEN 'prev7(09-02~09-09)' ELSE 'recent7(09-10~09-17)' END win,\\n       COUNT(*) down_events, ROUND(SUM(duration_minutes),0) down_min, ROUND(SUM(duration_minutes)/7,0) down_min_per_day\\nFROM mes_events WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND event_type='DOWN' AND date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-02' AND '2026-09-17'\\nGROUP BY win ORDER BY win\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:16.501903", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_b8816c63aeb849699a1a330a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "win | days | earned_per_day | actual_per_day | heads\n----------------------------------------\nrecent7 | 7 | 31.9 | 68.46 | 10\nprev7 | 7 | 34.0 | 50.56 | 10\n(2 rows)\n=== DOWN same windows ===\nwin | down_events | down_min | down_min_per_day\n----------------------------------------\nprev7(09-02~09-09) | 118 | 3540.0 | 506.0\nrecent7(09-10~09-17) | 156 | 4680.0 | 669.0\n(2 rows)", "id": "f36531efbb08411cb351ed69ded31b0f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:21.371644", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:21.373484", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Note heads = 10 for both windows when computed as DISTINCT employee over the window (dedup across days). Daily heads went 9→10.\n\nKey facts:\n- earned/day: 34.00 → 31.90 (-6.2%)\n- actual/day: 50.56 → 68.46 (+35.4%)\n- DOWN min/day: 506 → 669 (+32.2%)\n\nSo the drop is mainly driven by rising actual hours (投入人时), with downtime also up. Factual, not causal claim.\n\nLet me compute the % changes with calc.py for accuracy.\n\nAlso, let me get 当日 (09-17) 成品入库 and 生产完工 for context? Keep brief focused. Maybe add \"当日发货3批次、在途22批次(58台/套/件)\".\n\nLet me check the in-transit unit breakdown and whether in-transit belongs to overdue orders.\n\nAlso useful: 当日新增订单? Let me check orders created on 2026-09-17.\n\nLet me run these final data pulls.\n", "id": "ac34cb0e702d4e28bf37052484184df7", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:27.404029", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_91bc2a8954c4479998c869e1", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/calc.py 34.00,31.90 >/dev/null 2>&1; python3 - <<'PY'\\nprint(\\\"earned chg %.1f%%\\\" % ((31.90/34.00-1)*100))\\nprint(\\\"actual chg %.1f%%\\\" % ((68.46/50.56-1)*100))\\nprint(\\\"down chg %.1f%%\\\" % ((669/506-1)*100))\\nprint(\\\"eff chg %.2f%%\\\" % ((0.469421/0.676166-1)*100))\\nPY\\necho \\\"=== 在途单位 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT unit, COUNT(*) batches, SUM(quantity) qty FROM shipments WHERE status='在途' GROUP BY unit\\\" && echo \\\"=== 09-17 新下单 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) n FROM orders WHERE created_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\" && echo \\\"=== 09-17 成品入库 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT unit, SUM(-signed_quantity) qty, COUNT(*) n FROM wms_transactions WHERE transaction_type LIKE '%成品入库%' AND event_time LIKE '2026-09-17%' GROUP BY unit\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:30.927460", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_91bc2a8954c4479998c869e1", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "Command failed with exit code 1.\n[stdout]\nearned chg -6.2%\nactual chg 35.4%\ndown chg 32.2%\neff chg -30.58%\n=== 在途单位 ===\nunit | batches | qty\n----------------------------------------\n件 | 4 | 12\n台 | 15 | 37\n套 | 2 | 6\n批 | 1 | 3\n(4 rows)\n=== 09-17 新下单 ===\nn\n----------------------------------------\n4\n(1 rows)\n=== 09-17 成品入库 ===\n[stderr]\nSQL ERROR: no such column: transaction_type", "id": "63405972d8f747d29684dd20fdd898eb", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:35.070488", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:35.072174", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me check wms_transactions columns for the 成品入库 query. Actually, 成品入库 for the day is optional context. Let me check quickly.", "id": "fe585a5dc25144b8843653cf3ea59655", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:38.864050", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_99e87430d11347f2a97d3b06", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(wms_transactions)\\\" && echo \\\"=== types ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT transaction_type, COUNT(*) n FROM wms_transactions GROUP BY transaction_type\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09