n成品入库 | 台 | 3 | 1\n成品入库 | 套 | 2 | 1\n生产领料 | 套 | -20 | 3\n采购入库 | 件 | 5 | 1\n销售出库 | 件 | -3 | 1\n销售出库 | 台 | -4 | 1\n销售出库 | 套 | -4 | 1\n(8 rows)", "id": "292a372466b548468d607d1223d03659", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:50.085692", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:50.086685", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good context: 09-17 成品入库 3台 + 2套 (physical completion), 销售出库 4台+4套+3件 (shipments dispatched — matches 3 dispatched batches).\n\nNow I have everything. Let me write the brief. I'll produce a one-page markdown brief with evidence (SQL), save to datahub/output/daily_brief_2026-09-17.md (report day) — but careful: that file already exists from a prior run with the same name. The naming convention uses report date. Since the brief is \"2026-09-18 08:00 经营简报\" covering 2026-09-17, I should name it clearly. I'll write to `datahub/output/daily_brief_2026-09-18_0800.md` to avoid clobbering the earlier one, and mention it. Actually better: keep the canonical name but the earlier file is the same content essentially. Hmm — the earlier file is a 6-line version; my new one is a fuller one-page brief with evidence. I'll write a new file named `daily_brief_2026-09-18_0800.md` (brief generation time) and leave the old file intact.\n\nThen push via Mock endpoint with idempotency key. The prior run used idempotency_key \"daily-brief-20260917\" — if it was already pushed, a repeat would be idempotently ignored. Let me check whether the prior run pushed. The prior file exists; the script pushes by default. Let me check if the mock server is up and what it recorded. Let me try a GET or check for a log.\n\nI'll use a distinct idempotency key for this 08:00 brief push, e.g. \"daily-brief-20260918-0800\", so it isn't swallowed by the earlier key. But wait — is pushing appropriate? The user asked to \"生成2026-09-18 08:00经营简报\". The 需求5 spec says \"一页简报及推送\". Sending/publishing normally requires confirmation, but here the mock push is the sanctioned channel and is part of the defined deliverable for this task type, and it's a mock (no real external effect). The AGENTS.md says 发送动作仅限 Mock 推送接口. I think pushing to the mock endpoint is within the authorized scope of \"每日08点经营简报\" capability. It's a mock, non-destructive. I'll do it and report the result. Actually, per the \"Match the request\" contract: \"生成\" = generate. Pushing is an extra step beyond generate. But the skill's 需求5 explicitly bundles \"一页简报及推送\", and the mock push has no real-world effect. Hmm, the guidance says \"Ask before ... sends or publishes something\". A mock push to a local mock endpoint isn't a real send. The prior session already did this workflow. I'll do the push since it's the defined deliverable and explicitly sanctioned, and report the mock response.\n\nLet me first check the mock endpoint is alive.\n\nLet me now write the brief file and then push.\n\nBrief content (one page):\n\n【金汉隆 · 每日经营简报】2026-09-18 08:00（统计日 2026-09-17 00:00–23:59，Asia/Shanghai）\n\n一、昨日交付\n- 全量签收完成 2 单：SO20260814-00447（1台，08:24:57 签收）、SO20260815-00741（3台，19:20:28 签收）。口径：完成=订单全部批次均\"已签收\"且签收数量≥订单数量；分批发货/部分签收不计完成。\n- 当日发货 3 批次；截至快照在途 22 批次（台37、套6、件12、批3）。\n- 当日成品入库 3台 + 2套（台/套分别计，不相加折算）。\n\n二、异常（三个口径分列）\n- 异常事件条数 9 条；新增异常工单数 9 单（work_order_id 去重）；日末(09-17 23:59:59)未关闭异常工单 20 单（对应 24 条未关闭事件）。\n- 新增 9 条构成：节点超时 7（中）、物流延期 2（中1/高1）。\n- 未关闭存量中高严重度 5 单：MO20260702-0176、MO20260728-0181、MO20260807-00562、MO20260722-0179、MO20260906-0201（缺料，09-09 起）。\n\nWait — let me verify the high-severity open list: from the 24 rows: 高 severity rows: MO20260702-0176 物流延期高, MO20260906-0201 缺料高, MO20260807-00562 物流延期高, MO20260722-0179 物流延期高, MO20260805-0182 质检返工高, MO20260728-0181 物流延期高 = 6 rows. Distinct work orders: MO20260702-0176, MO20260906-0201, MO20260807-00562, MO20260722-0179, MO20260805-0182, MO20260728-0181 = 6 work orders. Let me verify with SQL rather than eyeballing.\n\n三、费用\n- 报销提交 2 笔（按报销单号去重），金额 3943.27 元（REIM00174 1041.83、REIM00465 2901.44，均\"审批中\"）。\n\n四、存量与逾期（事实，非预测）\n- 已生效订单 769 单；累计全量签收 680 单；未全量交付 89 单（其中 67 单尚无任何发货记录、22 单部分签收/在途）。\n- 已发生逾期 12 单（承诺交期已过且未全量签收，签收数量均为 0），最长 SO20260702-0176 逾期约 48 天。\n\nLet me verify 67 no-shipment + 22 partial = 89. Yes from earlier query: no_shipment 67, partial 22, not_done 89. \n\nWait: careful — \"partial\" here = signed_batches<batches OR signed_qty<quantity, which includes 在途未签收. And no_shipment=67 means no shipments rows at all. 67+22=89 ✓.\n\nHmm, but is \"no_shipment 67\" among effective orders only? Yes, computed on v_current_orders.\n\n五、趋势提示\n- 加工二组 WC02 人效（标准工时产出/实际投入人时）近 7 个有作业日均值 0.4694，前 7 日 0.6762，环比 -30.58%，14 点回归斜率 -0.0296 < 0 → 触发下降规则。\n- 同期事实：日均标准工时产出 34.00→31.90（-6.2%），日均实际投入人时 50.56→68.46（+35.4%），出勤 9→10 人；WC02 DOWN 事件 118→156 次、停机 506→669 分钟/日（+32.2%）。仅并列证据，不作因果结论。\n\n六、待办/复核\n- 12 单逾期需交付/采购/物流三方确认；MO20260906-0201 缺料异常已开放 9 天。\n\nPlus evidence SQL appendix.\n\nAlso should I include risk scores? Not needed for daily brief; 需求5 doesn't require probabilities. Good — avoids the \"演示评分未校准\" caveat. But I could reference the existing risk output. Keep it out or mention that risk scoring is in a separate report. I'll mention nothing about probabilities to keep it factual. Actually there's `_risk_raw.json` and `delivered_orders_20260918.csv` from prior sessions. Not needed.\n\nLet me verify the high-severity open work orders count and the overdue days, then write the file.", "id": "33e8a8cca59d41929207972ea96b81c0", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:54.094363", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_5970af12b3ce42b68d39e551", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) high_open_wo, COUNT(*) high_open_events FROM exceptions\\nWHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00') AND severity='高'\\\" && echo \\\"=== 高严重明细 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT DISTINCT work_order_id, exception_type, opened_at FROM exceptions\\nWHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00') AND severity='高' ORDER BY opened_at\\\" && echo \\\"=== 逾期天数分布 ===\\\" && python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n    SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) signed_qty\\n    FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT ROUND(MAX(julianday('2026-09-18T08:00:00')-julianday(o.promised_delivery_at)),1) max_days_over,\\n       ROUND(AVG(julianday('2026-09-18T08:00:00')-julianday(o.promised_delivery_at)),1) avg_days_over,\\n       SUM(o.contract_amount) overdue_amount\\nFROM v_current_orders o LEFT JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE (s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed_batches<s.batches OR s.signed_qty<o.quantity)\\n  AND o.promised_delivery_at < '2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00'\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:46:20.765847", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_5970af12b3ce42b68d39e551", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "high_open_wo | high_open_events\n----------------------------------------\n6 | 6\n(1 rows)\n=== 高严重明细 ===\nwork_order_id | exception_type | opened_at\n----------------------------------------\nMO20260702-0176 | 物流延期 | 2026-08-19T14:39:46+08:00\nMO20260906-0201 | 缺料 | 2026-09-09T01:12:12+08:00\nMO20260807-00562 | 物流延期 | 2026-09-11T02:19:16+08:00\nMO20260722-0179 | 物流延期 | 2026-09-11T23:08:06+08:00\nMO20260805-0182 | 质检返工 | 2026-09-12T12:00:00+08:00\nMO20260728-0181 | 物流延期 | 2026-09-17T17:30:04+08:00\n(6 rows)\n=== 逾期天数分布 ===\nmax_days_over | avg_days_over | overdue_amount\n----------------------------------------\n47.9 | 13.7 | 3027918.29\n(1 rows)", "id": "8b294bbf1a2d45fcb9d8a067e359c01a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:46:26.649642", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:46:26.650829", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "All facts verified. Now write the brief file and push to mock.\n\nNote overdue contract amount 3,027,918.29 CNY — that's 合同价值, must not be mixed with 折算产值. I'll label it clearly as 合同金额（未发生交付部分对应订单合同额）. Actually it's the full order contract_amount for those 12 orders. Label: \"12 单对应合同金额合计 302.79 万元（订单合同额口径，非收入确认）\".\n\nLet me write the file.\n", "id": "65887c6101004e31859fefe0f85a4274", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:46:28.278386", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_c217e32b048f43399590bbb1", "name": "write_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/output/daily_brief_2026-09-18_0800.md\", \"content\": \"# 金汉隆 · 每日经营简报（2026-09-18 08:00）\\n\\n- **快照时点**：2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00（`configuration.snapshot_at`，Asia/Shanghai）\\n- **统计窗口**：2026-09-17 00:00:00–23:59:59（前一完整自然日）；存量/逾期口径截至快照时点\\n- **样本范围**：仅已生效订单 769 单（800 笔源订单中 31 笔未来样本不计入）；完成 = **全量签收**\\n\\n## 一、结论先行\\n\\n1. 昨日**全量交付 2 单**（SO20260814-00447、SO20260815-00741），交付节奏偏慢；在途 22 批次待签收。\\n2. **异常存量在累积**：日末未关闭异常工单 20 单（其中高严重度 6 单），与当日新增 9 单基本持平但老化明显（最久 08-19 起）。\\n3. **12 单逾期为已发生事实**（承诺交期已过且签收数量为 0），对应订单合同额 302.79 万元，需今日三方（交付/采购/物流）确认。\\n4. **WC02 人效触发下降规则**（近 7 点均值 -30.58%、14 点斜率 -0.0296），直接表现为投入人时上升而标准工时产出略降，同期设备停机 +32.2%。\\n\\n## 二、昨日交付（2026-09-17）\\n\\n| 订单号 | 工单号 | 数量 | 单位 | 最后签收时间 | 判定 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| SO20260814-00447 | MO20260814-00447 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-17T08:24:57+08:00 | 全量签收 ✓ |\\n| SO20260815-00741 | MO20260815-00741 | 3 | 台 | 2026-09-17T19:20:28+08:00 | 全量签收 ✓ |\\n\\n- 批次口径与数量口径**双重校验一致**（signed_batches = batches 且 signed_qty ≥ 订单数量）。\\n- 当日发货 **3 批次**；截至快照**在途 22 批次**：台 37、套 6、件 12、批 3（单位分别统计，不相加折算）。\\n- 当日**成品入库 3 台 + 2 套**（台/套分列，非本企业设备产量的\\\"包装产品\\\"已排除）。\\n\\n## 三、异常（三个口径严格分列）\\n\\n| 指标 | 数值 | 口径 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 异常事件条数 | **9** 条 | `exceptions.opened_at` 落在 09-17 |\\n| 新增异常工单数 | **9** 单 | 按 `work_order_id` 去重 |\\n| 日末未关闭异常工单数 | **20** 单 | opened_at ≤ 09-17T23:59:59 且（未关闭或 closed_at > 该时点），工单去重；对应 24 条未关闭事件 |\\n\\n- 当日新增构成：节点超时 7（中）、物流延期 2（中 1 / 高 1）。\\n- **日末未关闭高严重度 6 单**：MO20260702-0176（物流延期，08-19 起）、MO20260906-0201（缺料，09-09 起）、MO20260807-00562（物流延期）、MO20260722-0179（物流延期）、MO20260805-0182（质检返工）、MO20260728-0181（物流延期，09-17 新增）。\\n- 注：EXM01196（MO20260825-00401）于 09-18T06:51:42 关闭，**晚于日末时点**，故仍计入日末未关闭存量。\\n\\n## 四、费用（报销）\\n\\n- 提交 **2 笔**（按报销单号去重），金额 **3,943.27 元**：REIM00174 1,041.83 元、REIM00465 2,901.44 元，状态均为\\\"审批中\\\"。\\n\\n## 五、存量与逾期（事实，非预测）\\n\\n| 指标 | 数值 |\\n|---|---|\\n| 已生效订单 | 769 单 |\\n| 累计全量签收 | 680 单（88.4%） |\\n| 未全量交付 | 89 单 = 无任何发货记录 67 单 + 部分签收/在途 22 单 |\\n| **已发生逾期** | **12 单**（承诺交期已过且未全量签收，签收数量均为 0） |\\n| 逾期时长 | 最长 47.9 天，平均 13.7 天 |\\n| 逾期对应合同额 | 3,027,918.29 元（订单合同额口径，**不是财务收入，也不与折算产值相加**） |\\n\\n逾期清单（按承诺交期升序）：SO20260702-0176、SO20260728-0181、SO20260807-00562、SO20260808-00752、SO20260814-0189、SO20260722-0179、SO20260812-00619、SO20260824-00596、SO20260805-0182、SO20260825-00401、SO20260826-00259、SO20260818-0183。\\n\\n## 六、趋势提示（WC02 人效）\\n\\n人效 = 标准工时产出 / 实际投入人时；工作中心按\\\"最近有作业日\\\"取点。\\n\\n| 窗口 | 有作业日 | 近7点人效均值 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 近 7 日（09-10~09-17） | 7 | **0.469421** |\\n| 前 7 日（09-02~09-09） | 7 | 0.676166 |\\n| 环比 | — | **-30.58%** |\\n| 14 点线性回归斜率 | — | **-0.029579**（<0） |\\n\\n→ 同时满足\\\"跌幅 >10% 且斜率为负\\\"，**触发下降提示**。同期可追溯辅助证据（仅并列，不作因果结论）：\\n\\n- 日均标准工时产出 34.00 → 31.90（-6.2%）；日均实际投入人时 50.56 → 68.46（**+35.4%**）；日出勤 9 → 10 人。\\n- WC02 设备 DOWN 事件 118 → 156 次，停机 506 → 669 分钟/日（**+32.2%**）。\\n- 建议核查：09-10 起 WC02 的排班/加班与停机记录，确认是投入人时口径异常还是有效产出下滑。\\n\\n## 七、今日待办\\n\\n1. 12 单逾期逐单定责（交付/采购/物流），优先 SO20260702-0176（逾期 47.9 天）、SO20260728-0181（31.9 天）。\\n2. MO20260906-0201 缺料异常已开放 9 天，需采购到货承诺与替代料方案。\\n3. 22 单部分签收/在途订单核对运单签收闭环，避免跨日漏计完成。\\n4. WC02 人效下降复核（停机 + 投入人时上升）。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 附：证据 SQL（`python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"...\\\"`，库 `datahub/agent_data.sqlite` 只读）\\n\\n```sql\\n-- 全量签收判定（批次 + 数量双口径），D='2026-09-17'\\nWITH s AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n   SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n   SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) signed_qty,\\n   MAX(received_at) last_received_at FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT o.sales_order_id FROM v_current_orders o JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE s.signed_batches=s.batches AND s.signed_qty>=o.quantity AND s.last_received_at LIKE '2026-09-17%';\\n\\n-- 异常三口径\\nSELECT COUNT(*) events, COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) wos FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at LIKE '2026-09-17%';\\nSELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) FROM exceptions\\nWHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00'\\n  AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00');\\n\\n-- 报销（按单号去重）\\nSELECT COUNT(DISTINCT expense_id), ROUND(SUM(amount),2) FROM expenses WHERE submitted_at LIKE '2026-09-17%';\\n\\n-- 存量 / 逾期：同上 CTE s，LEFT JOIN v_current_orders，\\n--   未全量交付 = s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR signed_batches<batches OR signed_qty<quantity\\n--   已逾期 = 上式 AND promised_delivery_at < '2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00'\\n\\n-- WC02 人效序列（按有作业日）\\nSELECT work_date, SUM(earned_standard_hours), SUM(actual_hours) FROM labor_logs\\nWHERE workcenter_id='WC02' GROUP BY work_date ORDER BY work_date;\\n-- 停机：SELECT COUNT(*), SUM(duration_minutes) FROM mes_events\\n--       WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND event_type='DOWN' AND date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-02' AND '2026-09-17';\\n```\\n\\n*口径出处：`datahub/docs/业务口径要点.md`（订单完成=全量签收；异常三口径；人效；趋势下降规则；台/套/件分别统计）。*\\n*本简报不含概率/评分类预测；逾期部分为已发生事实。*\\n\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:46:30